{"author":"Rebar Bot","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","author_sig":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","data":{"body":"Phase 4 decision — RP12 is REJECTED for this Janitor run. Maintainer rationale: pending OpenAI work is moving the integration from Chat to Responses, so introducing a single wire-dialect resolver now would prematurely bind a transition state and create avoidable compatibility churn. RP12 is excluded from Janitor Cleanup ticketization and should be reconsidered only after that migration establishes the intended compatibility state. No known-fine entry is authorized unless the maintainer separately confirms one."},"env_id":"eea68b7f-6697-488b-ac52-744e2ed8e96f","event_type":"COMMENT","timestamp":1788143869065478181,"uuid":"e0c30925-cbc4-4678-9898-857e3fb38dd5"}